# LF everywhere. The tooling (node, dotnet, cargo, git-bash) is line-ending
# agnostic, and the POSIX-sh git hooks must be LF, so normalize all text to LF in
# both the repo and every working copy. A CRLF commit would silently break the
# hooks the next time they run.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
